[MODE: ANALYZE]

我需要分析 SwitchModel 内置命令执行后，菜单弹出但用户超时不输入时，为什么会出现"思考中..."打印的问题。让我先定位相关代码。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查找思考中相关代码位置",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n '思考中' src/jarvis/ --type py -r '$0' 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

让我进一步定位 SwitchModel 内置命令的代码，以及看门狗机制如何触发。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查找 SwitchModel 内置命令代码",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n -i 'switchmodel\\|switch_model\\|SwitchModel' src/jarvis/ --type py -l 2>/dev/null"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "搜索模型切换相关代码",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n -i 'switch.model\\|switch_model\\|模型组\\|可用模型组' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "搜索模型切换功能代码",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n '模型组' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

找到了，`SwitchModel` 在 `src/jarvis/jarvis_utils/input.py` 第265行。让我查看相关代码。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看 SwitchModel 命令定义和相关处理逻辑",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_utils/input.py",
        "start_line": 250,
        "end_line": 320
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

现在让我查找 `SwitchModel` 的处理逻辑在哪里。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查找 SwitchModel 的处理逻辑",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n 'SwitchModel' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看 SwitchModel 在 builtin_input_handler 中的处理，以及在主程序中的实际实现",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 1510,
        "end_line": 1530
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

让我查看 `switch_model_group` 函数的实现。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看 switch_model_group 函数实现",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 1799,
        "end_line": -1
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

现在我找到了关键代码。问题在第1840行：`choice = input("请输入模型组编号 (0 取消): ").strip()`。这里使用了阻塞式 `input()`，在等待用户输入期间没有暂停"思考中"看门狗。

让我查看看门狗机制以及 `input.py` 中其他地方是如何处理暂停看门狗的。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看看门狗暂停机制在其他地方的使用方式",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n '看门狗\\|watchdog\\|pause_thinking\\|resume_thinking\\|thinking.*pause\\|pause.*thinking' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查找看门狗暂停机制",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n 'no_output_timer\\|_no_output\\|thinking_status\\|Status.*pause\\|pause.*status' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查找无输出看门狗的暂停机制",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n '暂停.*看门狗\\|看门狗.*暂停\\|pause.*watchdog\\|watchdog.*pause\\|suppress.*think\\|thinking.*suppress' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null | head -30"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

让我直接查看看门狗的实现代码。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看看门狗暂停机制实现",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_utils/output.py",
        "start_line": 100,
        "end_line": 200
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

现在我理解了看门狗机制。关键是 `OutputWatchdogPaused` 上下文管理器。让我查看它的定义以及 `input.py` 中其他输入处是如何正确暂停看门狗的。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看 OutputWatchdogPaused 的定义和 input.py 中正确使用的例子",
  "name": "execute_script",
  "arguments": {
    "interpreter": "bash",
    "script_content": "rg -n 'OutputWatchdogPaused' src/jarvis/ --type py 2>/dev/null"
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: ANALYZE]

问题定位清晰了！让我看看 `builtin_input_handler.py` 中正确使用 `OutputWatchdogPaused` 的示例，确认修复模式。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "查看 builtin_input_handler.py 中正确使用 OutputWatchdogPaused 的模式",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 355,
        "end_line": 365
      },
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 1150,
        "end_line": 1175
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: EXECUTE]

先精确读取要修改的代码段，确认上下文。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "精确读取 switch_model_group 中 while True 循环的代码",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 1835,
        "end_line": 1857
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: EXECUTE]

现在精确修改，用 `OutputWatchdogPaused` 包裹 `input()` 调用：

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "修复 SwitchModel 中 input() 未暂停看门狗的问题",
  "name": "edit_file",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "file_path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "diffs": [
          {
            "search": "    # 用户选择（循环直到输入有效）\n    PrettyOutput.auto_print(\"\")\n    while True:\n        choice = input(\"请输入模型组编号 (0 取消): \").strip()",
            "replace": "    # 用户选择（循环直到输入有效）\n    # 等待用户输入属于\"正常静默\"，暂停无输出看门狗，避免误触发思考中提示\n    try:\n        from jarvis.jarvis_utils.output import OutputWatchdogPaused\n    except Exception:\n        OutputWatchdogPaused = None\n    PrettyOutput.auto_print(\"\")\n    while True:\n        if OutputWatchdogPaused:\n            with OutputWatchdogPaused():\n                choice = input(\"请输入模型组编号 (0 取消): \").strip()\n        else:\n            choice = input(\"请输入模型组编号 (0 取消): \").strip()"
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>

[MODE: REVIEW]

静态检查的 mypy 错误全部来自项目其他文件（`rust_wrapper.py` 等），与本次修改无关，是项目已有的类型问题。让我验证修改后的代码是否正确。

<TOOL_CALL>
{
  "want": "验证修改后的代码",
  "name": "read_code",
  "arguments": {
    "files": [
      {
        "path": "src/jarvis/jarvis_agent/builtin_input_handler.py",
        "start_line": 1835,
        "end_line": 1866
      }
    ]
  }
}
</TOOL_CALL>
